 "containerId": null, "originalText": "This covers your forms, surveys, calendars and lead capture, and your tags, custom fields, triggers and actions. A form or survey starts everything, the lead gets a source tag and field,\nand the team is told.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_58", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1492, "y": -166, "width": 352, "height": 294, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2082899072, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 783156688, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_59", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -150, "width": 308, "height": 55, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1128488134, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1210883261, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - MANAGING THE\nOPPORTUNITY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - MANAGING THE\nOPPORTUNITY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_60", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -87, "width": 308, "height": 65, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17581914, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 625675343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "This covers your pipelines and opportunity\nstages and connecting leads to the right\npipeline. Every lead opens at New Lead so\nthe stage always shows where it stands.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "This covers your pipelines and opportunity\nstages and connecting leads to the right\npipeline. Every lead opens at New Lead so\nthe stage always shows where it stands.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_61", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -90, "width": 3832, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1799361520, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1585932014, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_62", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -74, "width": 3788, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1368426742, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 538981927, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - AUTOMATING THE FOLLOW-UP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - AUTOMATING THE FOLLOW-UP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_63", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -38, "width": 3788, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 231897702, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1961269854, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "This covers your workflows, automated follow-ups and email and SMS automation.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "This covers your workflows, automated follow-ups and email and SMS automation.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_64", "type": "rectangle", "x": 6074, "y": -118, "width": 2092, "height": 274, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1685254564, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1709696036, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_65", "type": "text", "x": 6096, "y": -102, "width": 2048, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1713601029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1692732590, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - STOP WHEN THEY REPLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - STOP WHEN THEY REPLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_66", "type": "text", "x": 6096, "y": -66, "width": 2048, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 444688429, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2068124765, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A small second workflow catches any reply, moves the opportunity to Replied and tags the lead so the follow-up stops wherever it is.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A small second workflow catches any reply, moves the opportunity to Replied and tags the lead so the follow-up stops wherever it is.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_67", "type": "rectangle", "x": 8364, "y": -118, "width": 1744, "height": 274, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1719888007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 267352361, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_68", "type": "text", "x": 8386, "y": -102, "width": 1700, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 818661758, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 289255806, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - STOP WHEN THEY BOOK ON THE CALENDAR", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - STOP WHEN THEY BOOK ON THE CALENDAR", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_69", "type": "text", "x": 8386, "y": -66, "width": 1700, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 896631051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1892478002, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A third workflow fires on the calendar booking, moves the opportunity to Call Booked and stops the follow-up the same way.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A third workflow fires on the calendar booking, moves the opportunity to Call Booked and stops the follow-up the same way.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_70"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 31.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - Lead Capture Form\nSubmitted", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - Lead Capture Form\nSubmitted", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "#bcd8f7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughne